{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_glaze_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_glaze_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "圣城晚照",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_glaze_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "420b7a3bf4da6b1e8150313ebcd7132ac616def5e63680b53d1feaa50731bfd2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哦......同学们，下课铃响了。我们的课程时间永远是这么短暂。\n虽然个别同学早在铃响前就溜走了，还有的一直趴在桌上睡大觉，但是这并无不妥。\n......“与铳械交流”本身就是一门将会伴随你们终身的课程。\n同学们啊，你们都已经拿到了属于自己的那一把守护铳。\n但你们想清楚将要用它守护什么了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "唔，我睡着了？......好吵啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "上司打来的电话......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......还是挂掉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "安比尔！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "怎么了，队长？我可一直在坚守岗位哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "坚守岗位......？我跟你说过多少次了！戍卫队就要有戍卫队的样子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "站好了！别躺在神圣的拉特兰高墙上！你这么喜欢躺着，怎么不躺在圣徒像的怀里？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "真的可以躺在圣徒像的怀里吗——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "你......你少跟我嬉皮笑脸的！别忘了，我们守护的可是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "拉——特——兰——的——荣——耀——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "哼，希望你能往心里去......今天是你的最后机会了，再搞砸，你就滚出戍卫队！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一座哨塔。\n这是守城人安比尔被分配看守的地方。一面宽大的围墙分隔了办公街区与休闲街区，这里屡次出现翻墙事件。\n她的工作很简单，只是阻止人们翻越围墙；她的工作也很困难，毕竟没人能遏制住拉特兰人那颗向往自由的心。\n守城人叼着巧克力，观察着这座蓝色与白色相叠交错的圣城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "钟楼一切正常，学校一切正常，办公区也一切正常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "直到目前为止，都没有什么异常......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守城人在终端上草草地写上几句工作记录，便再次躺在大理石露台上，慵懒地望向那片云天。\n她不止一次产生过这样的感觉。\n这座圣城，这座平静、安宁，又一成不变的圣城——\n真像是天空落在这片大地上的倒影啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......下班后，要去哪逛逛呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哎哟——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "好痛......是谁拿巧克力砸我？害得我掉下来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "这里禁止通行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "你随意翻越围墙的行为，违反了街区管理法则，也扰乱了戍卫队日常的防卫工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "可......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "顺带一提哦，我只是例行办事，上面那句话也是复述我上司的原话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "如果有任何异议，你可以去戍卫队抗议，也可以向公证所呈文申诉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "不过，要是你有正当理由，我也可以放你过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "正当理由......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "我现在确实要赶路......如果不从这里翻墙走，我就要绕好大一圈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "你看到那边的侧门了吗？它应该能帮你省去不少路程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "你只要等一会儿，等到下班时间，从那个门走过去就行咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "这个理由驳回了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "等等......下班时间？那可不行，我肯定会错过的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "错过什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "......不行，我不能说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "配合执行机密遗嘱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "（摇头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "也对，你看上去也不像是执行者......那么，协助运送重要物资？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "（摇头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "看来也不是信使......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "但、但是......和这些差不多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "反正......我要去做的，是对我来说非常关键的事，而且今天是唯一的机会！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "这么夸张吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "对不起，我确实不能再耽误时间了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敏捷的拉特兰人",
      "text": "别、别追了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敏捷的拉特兰人",
      "text": "可恶，该往哪边跑......这边好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的执行者",
      "text": "请你配合公证所的工作，不要再拒捕了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的执行者",
      "text": "欸......？分岔口？他跑到哪边去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "（指左边）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的执行者",
      "text": "哦，好！多谢你，小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "......那个，守城人小姐，请问可以放我走了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "等等，我有一个好主意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一条小巷。\n太阳正向西落，楼宇影子遮住街巷的半边，是个打盹的好地方。\n守城人捂紧了耳朵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "......守城人小姐，你想出的办法就是用炸药给围墙开个大洞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "是啊，怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "规定不许翻墙，又没规定不许给墙开个洞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "还傻站着干嘛，你不着急走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "心急的拉特兰人",
      "text": "......好！多谢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "那么，这位执行者先生，接下来就要请你帮忙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的执行者",
      "text": "没问题，小事一桩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的执行者",
      "text": "......4月27日下午4点27分，位于帕尼拉大街与舒芙蕾大街交界处的一面围墙完成合法爆破。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爽朗的执行者",
      "text": "已在公证所执行者里凯莱的见证下执行完毕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "戍卫队狙击手，安比尔，已确保爆破行为未威胁公民的生命财产安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "搞定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "谢谢咯，执行者先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "没什么，刚才也多亏了你，我才能抓到这家伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被铐住的拉特兰人",
      "text": "呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "我也没做什么，就是指个方向嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "哈哈哈，别谦虚嘛，我知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "那根立柱是你用铳击倒的，对不对？如果没有你，这家伙也不会被拦住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "这么远的距离......现在戍卫队都要配备像你这么厉害的狙击手吗？真是可怕啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "欸，这算是在夸我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "倒是你们这些空手就能解决问题的执行者才更可怕吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "在和平的拉特兰，很难想象也会有你们不得不使用铳械的情形。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "哈哈哈，要是不用铳械，怎样才能在甜品店射击比赛里赢下甜甜圈大奖呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "好了，守城人小姐，没有别的事我就先回去交差了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "正好，有这个洞，我也省得绕远路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "嗯？......等等，这条路好像通往那个地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凯莱",
      "text": "天，没想到我今天还真能赶上，我本以为绝对没机会了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被铐住的拉特兰人",
      "text": "哇——好痛！请慢点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "什么地方啊，怪神秘的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "安比尔！！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "又什么事啊，队长？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "我以为在我打来之前，你已经想好怎么解释墙上的大洞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "没有人违反规定哦，我真的有好好坚守岗位的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "......少跟我耍花招！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "从现在开始，你的工作多了一项——看好那个洞，不许让任何人通过！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一座斜阳里的城市。\n将两个雪糕筒路障摆放在围墙上的洞前，守城人忽然感受到一道目光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "好无聊啊，队长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "你就算要监督我，也没必要藏起来吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那道身影躲在树后，小心地探出了头，却正好对上守城人的目光，马上又把脸藏了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......是个孩子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "......别、别过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "我记得，现在应该还没到放学时间吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "劝你乖乖回到教室，我会当没看到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "也......也先别走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "请待在原地就好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "我......我就想看看你的铳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "我的铳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......看你的样子，好像是快要到选择守护铳的年纪了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "喏，这下能看得更清楚了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "怎么，让你失望了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "为、为什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "为什么......你的守护铳和圣徒像的守护铳长得那么像？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "这个嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "孩子，还没选好你的守护铳吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "工坊里的存货都给你看过了，如果你全都不喜欢，或许......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的安比尔",
      "text": "我要这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "哪个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "......你是指圣徒像拿着的那把长铳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "可那是雕塑上的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "......我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "那把铳是过去的经典款式，我应该还能找到拆解图。现做一把得花点时间，过几天你来取就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的安比尔",
      "text": "多谢你，工匠先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "这不算什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铳械工坊工匠",
      "text": "倒是像你一样以圣徒为榜样的孩子，现在可太少见咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "我选择它做守护铳......没什么特别的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "它很轻，射程也足够远，仅此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "射程足够远？可我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "没关系。使用它，不需要特别高超的射击天赋，也不需要什么伟大的志向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "它就是一把铳，你当然也可以选择一模一样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "只要你想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "......对不起，你可能误会了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "书上说圣徒的子弹就是律法降下的惩罚，被打中的话特别特别疼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羞怯的孩子",
      "text": "我只是想确认一下，要是我偷偷穿过这个洞，这把圣徒的铳，应该不会向我开火吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "目送逃学的孩子返回学校之后，守城人行过街角。\n晚钟还未敲响，街上只有零星的几个行人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "两个巧克力冰淇淋球，再加点可可碎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "好嘞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......今天这里好冷清啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "嗯......可能是因为帕尼拉大街那边的甜品店正在举行限时活动吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "限时活动？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "是啊，据说在卖特别限定版巧克力黄昏慕斯，只有今天一天，而且活动到五点半就截止了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "特别限定版巧克力黄昏慕斯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "五点半就结束......好多人还没有下班、没有放学呢，不是都赶不上了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "可不是嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "有些人啊，就算是请假，也一定要去买呢，我这里可竞争不过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "怪不得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的店主",
      "text": "喏，拿好您的冰淇淋，谢谢惠顾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守城人一转头，忽然看见一旁的下水井盖正在诡异地跳动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂，喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有人在吗？谁能来帮帮我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "来，抓住它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的老人",
      "text": "哎哟，可算得救了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的老人",
      "text": "嗯？把我从下水道里拉上来的这把长铳......我好像在哪里见过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......老师？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的老人",
      "text": "......原来是安比尔，好久不见啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "真好，看上去你已经成长为一名出色的守城人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "你为什么会在下水道里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "啊哈哈，我是在和我的守护铳交流啊，就像我以前教你的那样，不记得了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......是说在禁闭室的那次吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外面的声音",
      "text": "我爸爸做了超甜奶油蛋糕！谁想吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外面的声音",
      "text": "还有还有，这是我家店里做的蜂蜜瘤奶昔，谁要喝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外面的声音",
      "text": "哎！你干什么？快把我的巧克力还给我！还给我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被关禁闭的学生",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被关禁闭的学生",
      "text": "我被关了多久了？好饿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被关禁闭的学生",
      "text": "只要踩在椅子上，我就能从高窗翻出去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学校老师",
      "text": "很好，看来你的确有学到什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被关禁闭的学生",
      "text": "......老师？我不是想要......我下次不会再......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学校老师",
      "text": "我明白。禁闭室能关住你的人，但是并不能关住你的心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学校老师",
      "text": "你用铳打碎了高窗的玻璃，这就是你和铳械交流的结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被关禁闭的学生",
      "text": "我明知道这违反了学校的规定，可我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学校老师",
      "text": "......没关系的，孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学校老师",
      "text": "铳械之所以重要，就是因为它能让你正视自己的内心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学校老师",
      "text": "拉特兰也因此才能变得越来越好，成为守护人们心之所向的乐园。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被关禁闭的学生",
      "text": "心之所向......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "学校老师",
      "text": "告诉我，安比尔，你现在最想要什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被关禁闭的学生",
      "text": "我......我想要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被关禁闭的学生",
      "text": "我想要......巧克力......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "对，对，没错！你该不会是还在记恨我关你禁闭吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "不过，看到你手上的巧克力冰淇淋，我就知道你并没有遗忘我的教诲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......被你这么说，我有点不想吃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "所以，老师又是因为什么样的心之所向，才钻进了下水道里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "不去管学生们，偷偷跑出来，真的没问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "哈哈，你看，这是我的守护铳。刚刚我握着它在学校的祷告厅祈祷，忽然感受到一股强烈的呼唤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "顺着它的指引，我发现祷告厅地下竟有一个神秘通道。走到尽头，我就看到头顶有光亮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "我本以为我将见证奇迹，结果......你也看到了，我卡在了这个下水道口动弹不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "说得那么玄之又玄的，老师其实就是想翘班吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "不，我想我的守护铳想要的更简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "它一定只是想看看，拉特兰今天的夕阳吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "顺便......要是能赶上今天的甜品店限时活动就更好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......果然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "这个理由可不足以让你逃脱责罚哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "涉嫌破坏下水管线，扰乱正常通行秩序，以及在非开放时间翻越围墙，虽然是从地下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "好啦安比尔，之后我会主动去公证所领罚的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "可要是错过了限定版甜品，还错过了圣城一天中最辉煌的时分，那就太可惜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在此时，戍卫队的新兵们在街对面列队行过。\n金色的夕照落在他们的铳上，落在他们的帽檐上，落在他们稚嫩却庄严的面容上。\n就像流淌在瘤奶吐司上的枫糖浆，也像倾倒在华夫饼上的蜂蜜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "夕阳......是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "夕阳总会平等地洒在圣城的每个角落，这堵围墙可拦不住它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守城人举起长铳，瞄准远方钟楼的顶端，深呼吸——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "街上的行人抬起头来，楼宇里的居民望向窗外，街区中的所有拉特兰人几乎在同一时刻屏息——\n钟声鸣响，几只羽兽披着霞光，徐徐飞过晴空。\n短暂的沉默后，欢声笑语带着人们的心之所向，从街区的各个角落纷至沓来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "45分19秒。比预定的钟声响起时间早了45分19秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "本街区的下班时间也将提早45分19秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "他们可以早点走出房间，与朋友们交谈去哪里度过愉快的夜晚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "更重要的是，大家都不会错过如此美好的夕阳，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "安比尔，你是为了让大家都赶上甜品店的限时活动吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......哈哈，还有十多分钟，我反正肯定能赶上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "老师，我可以和你一起去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "不接？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "不接，我下班了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精神的老人",
      "text": "......还真是乱来啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的拉特兰人",
      "text": "奇怪，今天的钟声是不是响得太早了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "过路的拉特兰人",
      "text": "哇！夕阳真好看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的拉特兰人",
      "text": "我有一个提议，以后每年的这一天，我们都早一个小时下班吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "过路的拉特兰人",
      "text": "我同意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守城人看见霞云后的落日露出头来，圣城在天空中的倒影也向她眨了眨眼。\n不觉间，街上已经人来人往。在拉特兰平凡的一天中，到处洋溢着自由与欢笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "这才是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "......拉特兰的荣耀啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
